"],"video":"","videos":[]},"full":true,"addedAt":"2026-10-13T11:25:07.936Z","content":[{"t":"text","v":"今天给大家带来的是国产库里南:红旗E-HS9后尾灯的拆解。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChBFd7NNWqUEnDbGY9x1ia9DXWibkHa2z5M4bSiaNz9kbQRRyK4Wzglhslw/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChdCnhA61mCJ48t5QyjXDVhvbWwt89hnCF7w9y7mFO9CVWiauMvfw0L8w/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"红旗E-HS9的尾灯内部采用点阵式灯板与光带式相结合的设计，点亮后具有强烈的层次感和深邃感，呈现出立体而时尚的视觉效果，体现了现代汽车科技与设计的完美融合。其两侧尾灯融入分叉式设计，呈Y字形与贯穿车尾的灯带相连，并向下延伸至后翼子板，营造出饱满大气的视觉效果，同时也拉伸了车尾的视觉宽度，使车辆看起来更加稳重、豪华；而且在车辆解锁与上锁时，尾灯拥有一场华丽的“光影”动画秀，为车辆增添了一份科技感和仪式感，给用户带来独特的体验 。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/bfpNckwxSiaOWicNcMYrEDWpGEnh7vPJFMaJJIN6o8QaCFpjy2sWQEhlibMmn8eudicul5zgL6Ux5agZajp9jEOa4w/640?wx_fmt=gif&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"(以上均摘自网络)步入正题，开拆"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChpbDnkm5KKxEhX6DvBSibpSb2QJtqGMxrbyJDrm580Rs5eAJfssWZibBQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"本次拿到的是左侧后尾灯总成。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChWIKDwH1SOd4L6z8HCjskJyCicxJdoD3icNiaCp4v6XXbnQdthjeDVPqMg/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"背面"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChqicTIvYqnSO08kof5x2ic4XpXaAHibPD9QOb8nzmAlLzzBoe4P8C4Rh1g/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"灯壳上有各部件材质信息。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChicrkgD9k7hvFTb8MnrbnrqTwofJAIYRulxeXfWnVhwiapuHN88YSUib5A/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"红旗和星宇的LOGO"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChyhmpME5hs3dWia0Sxdx6qib7J0NOich96fpMVfZIZibqauuiavxyoDyOdIQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"各部分的功耗信息。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChjKdc77v9aAWvvqCGiaPDjgGQ9rmw1zaohODkABABeRDaZLymkxkk3icA/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"拆掉边框，四周包胶设计，避免与车体干涉摩擦。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChFibZtNg7Kq08Yu0I1eD12NfFADuMCJ3tV1lb1ImV6VZNSdo47SOC3ng/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"灯罩尖角部位加厚处理，厚度比中间厚约2mm。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChjtQPMrdOvXtEuz4UTP502EN9Xe2a7PcI60ANhsTv5Hw7bsthDB6iaiaw/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"上方镀铝装饰条是双面胶粘的(开始笔者以为是焊接的)，这样坏了换新比较方便。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChicrapuybEicEVgibAVgnLyLiaf8y6A3CDPjgAyzWYJP62LoDKSjyNev3VA/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"灯罩去除"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChov53AauJkOtficPT4bicncNibpNibKLksibgJdNib5L3Yx4ldXiagrc1aGmPw/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"该灯采用的是热板焊工艺。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChMiayVfPic77CD7SZxtJuyNXodOTJJcBmXbHvsR4xMTAwgcicftwmNWOcQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"分解"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChy2thOpskic4icR1R22I3naPhSq4icmg6egTIQ6qWSxFAK6O23Z19POYcQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChaOmDbeZwDNHeJNr9LCZ0cicCCdxm9nhl11iaqyj6EdAoxwdvvOxcWu1g/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"透光灯框，双色成型，也是组成点亮效果的主力。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChYRWgoV2WQwz5uzn8t7YIDUk9kD8jDbhX3tYC36zBQ6oNUFhVydlCdA/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"主线束细节"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2NiclDLFjChlRos0EcRWa2owezA9hftwhlV6gVgicoUOO7Bib4wTBLPcxLVy48JCryQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"拔掉主线束，L8是主控板"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMc6e8YjicXRkH2Ni